WEBVTT

00:07:28.762 --> 00:07:31.787
But if you're not careful
about how you choose,

00:07:31.811 --> 00:07:32.976
you wind up with this.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.747
(Laughter)

00:07:34.771 --> 00:07:37.603
This is an un-retouched --
this is not a joke --

00:07:37.627 --> 00:07:39.889
un-retouched photo of Microsoft Word,

00:07:39.913 --> 00:07:42.747
the copy that you have,
with all the toolbars open.

00:07:42.771 --> 00:07:46.093
You've obviously never
opened all the toolbars,

00:07:46.117 --> 00:07:50.859
but all you have to type in
is this little, teeny window down here.

00:07:50.883 --> 00:07:53.442
(Laughter)

00:07:53.466 --> 00:07:56.911
And we've arrived at the age
of interface matrices,

00:07:56.935 --> 00:07:59.077
where there are so many
features and options,

00:07:59.101 --> 00:08:01.021
you have to do two dimensions, you know: